    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54420" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλογάδην</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>by way of conversation, in
				prose</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. συγγράφειν,
			διηγεῖσθαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				177b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ly.</u>
				204d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κ. συγγράμματα</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μετὰ μέτρου ποιήματα</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				2.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ κ. ἴαμβοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					10.445b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.694
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.316d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.418
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Oropus</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1.3a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>in detail, longwindedly</i>, <i><span class="en">
